<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Dresdner Bank, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett,</p>
<p>Helaba and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    08.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.5275   PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
